        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek BTB-86693, Back-to-Back Jasper Front Door Pull Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Jasper Door Pull Set comes packaged as a set of 2 door pulls to be mounted on a back-to-back on a single door that is 1-3/8 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick. The Jasper Back-to-Back Handle Pair is available in several of the most popular finish colors in either 12 inch or 18 inch lengths. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. Packaged with 2 door pulls (1 door pull for each side of a door).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/jasper-door-pull-emtek-86693\"><b>Jasper Pull with Thru-Bolt Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Back-to-Back Jasper Front Door Handle Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with (2) door pulls,  (2) 2-1/2\" #10-32 screws, and (2) #10-32 set screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-DP86693-specifications.pdf?v=1704262400\"><b>Emtek Jasper Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-BTB-86693:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 13-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-BTB-86694:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 19-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back-to-Back mounting.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
